        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"30119\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If I had to choose a Sentinels character to carry out a similar plot, Parse seems like the best hero, and Miss Information the best villain.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I mean… I feel like, because of the power levels, that this would be less a Freedom Five thing and more a Prime Wardens thing. But overall, I think that’s either a Parse thing, a Soothsayer Carmichael thing, or an Expatriette thing.</p>",
