        "created_at": "2023-07-09T00:43:02.628Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"30119\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>One major aspect of the Caped Crusader is his detective skills; I think that NightMist is really the only detective hero that Sentinels has?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>RPG Wraith has d10 Investigation, d10 Deduction and Principle of the Detective, y’know.  Think she’s qualified.</p>",
