        "id": 253130,
        "name": "",
        "username": "skywhale",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/skywhale/{size}/5248_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-07-09T22:02:13.295Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"25\" data-topic=\"30119\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Batman isn’t a detective by trade either</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grimacing.png?v=12\" title=\":grimacing:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":grimacing:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grimacing.png?v=12\" title=\":grimacing:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":grimacing:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grimacing.png?v=12\" title=\":grimacing:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":grimacing:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Batman? AKA “World’s Greatest Detective”? Star of DC Comics? Formerly known as Detective Comics?</p>\n<p>But yeah, that was a joke about “Stuntman/Batman can beat anyone… with enough prep time.”</p>",
