      {
        "id": 253131,
        "name": "",
        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-07-09T22:45:56.683Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I mean to say that it’s not his <em>job</em>. Yes, I do agree that he is a great detective, but it’s not his source of income. It’s an overly pedantic, hair-splitting distinction, I know.</p>\n<p>Also, the answer to whether Batman can defeat someone isn’t how prepared he is, <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/DependingOnTheWriter\">it’s whether the writer wants him to</a>. : )</p>",
